 EPIC bob-cli-mw[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Daily Headline: one line a day, shown wherever the week looks at [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]its days[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every daily note can carry one Bryan-written `**Headline:**` line [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]naming the result that would make the day count. bob reads it (and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never writes it) and serves it to the week note's Days table and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]strip, the weekly brief, the terminal, and the top of the Bob Mac [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Capture idle agenda. A concise POST checklist row in gtd_daily.md [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prompts it each morning.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]daily_headline.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/daily_headline.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mw[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mw/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli reads the Daily Headline and serves it[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the shared daily-headline parser, put `headline` on week-report[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]day columns and children, day brief parts, and `capture-pomodoros [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--tasks`, update terminal output, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Week note Days table and strip show each day's headline[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins: bob-ledger-tools reads the day-row `headline`, renders it in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Days table Summary (future days too), adds it to week-strip day [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tooltips, then builds, tests, and syncs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Headline row at the top of the Mac idle agenda[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode the snapshot `headline`, add a fixed headline row under the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Today title, measure, plan, and draw it, cover it with tests and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]design render, update docs, and gate on macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Template slot, morning checklist row, and POST stage[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault: add the empty `**Headline:**` slot to the daily template, add the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]concise staged POST row to gtd_daily.md, apply the morning-clause and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]staging decisions, and verify end to end.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mw","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mw.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5e83e94e1fa93a13b40d284308906c1e","started_at":"2026-11-17T22:25:16.297051+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"41dcb7e7b5fd86a2ff90332fcca00c7a9fbba709914ffde52805ff1d264f1db5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mw